OL,3,GNEWSAMan pulled from lake died from
OL,4,Adrowning - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest was opened at Nottingham
OL,7,FCoroner's Court on Wednesday, and was
OL,8,Fadjourned until 26 November.
